  "type": "multiple-choice",
  "originalQuery": "You have deployed a Bare Metal Solution for Oracle in Region A and a Cloud Spanner instance in Region B. You need to configure connectivity between the two regions with optimal performance and minimal latency. What should you do?",
  "originalOptions": "A. Set up VPC Network Peering between the VPCs in Region A and Region B and enable global dynamic routing.<br/>B. Use a public IP for the Bare Metal Solution and configure a public endpoint for the Cloud Spanner instance.<br/>C. Configure a high-availability Cloud VPN connection between Region A and Region B.<br/>D. Set the dynamic routing mode in your VPC network to regional.",
  "domain": "Manage a solution that can span multiple database solutions",
  "hasImage": false,
