  "queryImages": [],
  "deprecatedReference": false,
  "deprecatedMatches": {},
  "qid": "236",
  "tip": "<p>When you see a requirement for <i>private</i> connectivity with <i>lowest latency</i> across regions, choose VPC peering and set dynamic routing to <i>global</i>. Remember to enable custom route export and import if Cloud Router learned routes must traverse the peering.</p>",
